<newsitem itemid="14097" id="root" date="1996-08-26" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Distillers lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Distillers lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		93.5    vs  69.8</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	42.0    making 59.0 vs 49.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 130.9    vs  97.7</p>
<p>    Before tax	    226.6    vs 182.9</p>
<p>    Tax			86.4    vs  74.8</p>
<p>    Interest earned	21.1    vs  17.6</p>
<p>    Turnover	    1,532.6    vs 1,247.9</p>
<p>Div payable: Oct 18</p>
<p>On register: Sept 20</p>
<p>Name - Distillers Corporation (SA) Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it expected a gradual decline in economic activity this year. It said it was well positioned to take advantage of opportunities in domestic and international markets and expected &quot;satisfactory real growth&quot; in turnover and earning.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
